    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d868">

                <pb facs="1070" n="1056" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg1056"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">822.51/10–2645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ecuador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Shaw</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-26T20:00:00-05:00">October 26, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 26—4:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>766. For Export-Import Bank from Applegate. Due to delays and lack of interest in
                    certain government departments regarding plans for reorganization, approval of
                    reforms of statutes and payment to corporation of 5 percent commission, interest
                    and installment due on investment in Quevedo–Manta project, Mr. Shaw, Chargé
                    d’Affaires Embassy arranged appointment for me with Minister Trujillo<anchor
                        n="38" xml:id="d868-f1"/> with whom I discussed the whole situation and he
                    informed the President<anchor n="39" xml:id="d868-f2"/> of the situation with
                    the result of immediate action by <pb facs="1071" n="1057" xml:id="pg1057"/>
                    Minister of Economy. In session yesterday afternoon and this morning with
                    Minister Economy [and] representative of Foreign Office reforms of statutes were
                    approved and tentative plans for reorganization made by which Govt agreed to
                    reimburse corporation for assets to be transferred, also to study means to
                    furnish funds for Quevedo-Manta continued construction. … [Applegate.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shaw</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
